    return "# H# Web Application\n\nA minimal HTTP web server template for H#.\n\n## Run\n```bash\nh# run src/main.h#\n# Open http://localhost:8080\n```\n\n## Routes\n- `GET /` — HTML index page\n- `GET /api/hello` — JSON hello response\n- `POST /api/echo` — Echo body as JSON\n"
